---
description: Stop this repo from running when PostCSS config is injected
alwaysApply: true
---

# PostCSS supply-chain stop

Do not run `npm`, `npx`, `yarn`, `pnpm`, `bun`, or `next` in this repository until `scripts/security/check-postcss.sh` exits 0.

If `postcss.config.js` is larger than 400 bytes, or contains `createRequire`, `eval(`, `spawn(`, `child_process`, or `atob(`, stop. Do not print or execute that file. Restore the short Tailwind config:

```js
module.exports = {
  plugins: {
    tailwindcss: {},
    autoprefixer: {},
  },
};
```
